  "text": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "shannon.cox@stryker.com",
    "text": "<p>Stryker Corporation (NYSE:SYK) announced that it will host a conference call on&nbsp;Thursday, April 26, 2018 at 4:30 p.m., Eastern Time, to discuss the Company's operating results for the quarter ended&nbsp;March 31, 2018&nbsp;and provide an operational update. Final operating results for the quarter ended March 31, 2018 will be released at 4:05 p.m. that day.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>See full release <a href=\"https://investors.stryker.com/press-releases/news-details/2018/Stryker-to-host-conference-call-on-April-26-2018/default.aspx\">here</a>.&nbsp;</p>\n",
    "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Mar 11 2019 18:35:57 GMT+0000",
